  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Administrativa kostnader Myndigheten f&#xf6;r psykologiskt f&#xf6;rsvar (MPF)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Administrative costs Swedish Agency for Psychological defence (MPF)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Administrativa kostnader/f&#xf6;rvaltningskostnader. Administrativa kostnader inkluderar rekrytering av personal f&#xf6;r implementering av Myndigheten f&#xf6;r psykologiskt f&#xf6;rsvars arbete att genomf&#xf6;ra olika internationella bist&#xe5;ndsinsatser i syfte att st&#xe4;rka motst&#xe5;ndskraften och f&#xf6;rm&#xe5;gan till att motverka otillb&#xf6;rlig informationsp&#xe5;verkan. Rekryteringen ska bidra till att myndigheten mer effektivt kan arbeta med utlysningar vid b&#xe5;de korta och l&#xe4;ngre utlysningsf&#xf6;rfaranden till relevanta tj&#xe4;nster inom myndighetens ansvarsomr&#xe5;de.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Administrative costs/overhead costs. Administrative costs include the recruitment of personnel for the implementation of the  Swedish Agency for Psychological defence&apos;s (MPF) work to carry out various international co-operation support efforts with the aim of strengthening resilience and the ability to counteract undue information influence. The recruitment will contribute to the agency being able to work more effectively with announcements in both short and longer announcement procedures for relevant positions within the agency&apos;s area of &#x200b;&#x200b;responsibility</narrative>
  </description>
